From: Noswad <64293615+TheNoswad@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 13:10:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] pipeline: simple: Add the Google gs101 MIPI-CSIS receiver

The gs101 (Tensor) CSIS driver captures raw Bayer from the sensor
through the CSIS write-DMA into a single video node, with no ISP.
Use it with the software ISP.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
--- a/src/libcamera/pipeline/simple/simple.cpp
+++ b/src/libcamera/pipeline/simple/simple.cpp
@@ -257,6 +257,7 @@
 
 static const SimplePipelineInfo supportedDevices[] = {
 	{ "dcmipp", {}, false },
+	{ "gs101-mipi-csis", {}, true },
 	{ "imx7-csi", { { "pxp", 1 } }, true },
 	{ "intel-ipu6", {}, true },
 	{ "intel-ipu7", {}, true },
